    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="El. 41">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> El. 41</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ne wend ðu ðe no on þæs folces unræd ⁊ unryht gewill on hiora spræce ⁊ geclysp ofer ðin ryht, ⁊ ðæs unwisestan lare ne him ne geðafa.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Do not turn to the folly and unjust desire of the people, in their words and their clamor, against that which is lawful for you, nor agree to their most unwise counsel.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ne gewend þu ðe no on þæs folces unræd, ond on unriht gewil on hiora spræce ond geclebs ofer ðin ryht, ond þæs unwisestan lare þu ne geþafa.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
